            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "rules": [
    "Source classes order is positional, never sort at runtime.",
    "Worker emits seven scores only; Core alone compares expected class, validates guards, decides verdict.",
    "Core persists pinned policy and capture request before submission; evidence with projection is committed before a side effect or completion.",
    "Captured frames must be new, distinct, after request (POST_CLOSE after stable close), >=100ms apart, and within one 3000ms deadline; aggregate result <=2000ms old.",
    "No public camera capture/upload/file paths or images; UART-v1 is unchanged."
  ],
